# Frontend Architecture Guide

Conventions for the **Biblio Squad** frontend (marketing site + admin backoffice). Follow this when implementing or refactoring UI.

Companion rules (do not duplicate here):
- `.cursor/rules/label-typography.mdc` — `Label` / `EVariantLabel`
- `.cursor/rules/i18n.mdc` — `next-intl` copy

---

## Technology Stack

| Area | Choice |
| --- | --- |
| Framework | Next.js 15.5.x (App Router) |
| UI | React 19.1.x |
| Language | TypeScript 5.x |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS 4.x (+ SASS where needed) |
| Forms | `@tanstack/react-form` + Zod 4.x |
| Data | `@tanstack/react-query` |
| Auth | NextAuth.js 4.x |
| i18n | next-intl 4.x (`fr` / `en` / `ar`) |
| Motion | Framer Motion 12.x |

Key patterns:
- `[locale]` + `(private)` / public marketing routes
- Next.js `/api/*` proxies to NestJS
- Session JWT forwarded on proxied calls (`customToken` in Route Handlers — not `withToken: true` on the server)

---

## Project Structure

```
frontend/
├── locales/                 # next-intl JSON (fr, en, ar)
├── src/
│   ├── app/                 # App Router
│   │   ├── [locale]/       # Localized pages
│   │   │   ├── (private)/ # Backoffice (auth)
│   │   │   └── …          # Public marketing
│   │   └── api/             # Proxies → NestJS
│   ├── components/
│   │   ├── Primitives/      # Reusable UI building blocks
│   │   ├── Organisms/       # Composite sections / tables / headers
│   │   ├── Templates/       # Page-level layouts
│   │   ├── Layouts/         # LayoutWrapper, LocaleMarketingShell, …
│   │   ├── Modals/
│   │   └── providers/
│   ├── common/              # StandardApi, validation, helpers
│   ├── contexts/
│   ├── hooks/
│   ├── interfaces/
│   ├── types/
│   ├── theme/               # colors.ts, typography.ts
│   ├── lib/                 # routes.ts, *-api.ts
│   ├── assets/
│   └── i18n/
└── package.json
```

Pages live under `src/app/[locale]/…/page.tsx`. Reusable UI: **Primitives → Organisms → Templates / Modals**.

---

## Component Architecture

Hierarchy (no separate Atoms/Molecules folders — those were merged into **Primitives**):

1. **Primitives** — `src/components/Primitives/`  
   Single-purpose UI: `Button`, `Input`, `Label`, `Icon`, `Spinner`, `Badge`, `Modal`, `Sidebar`, `ImageUpload`, …
2. **Organisms** — `src/components/Organisms/`  
   Larger composites: tables, headers, footers, file uploaders, …
3. **Templates** — `src/components/Templates/`  
   Page wireframes (shop, home sections, auth templates, …)
4. **Pages** — App Router `page.tsx`  
   Data fetching, mutations, compose Templates / Organisms / Modals

### Naming

| Kind | Pattern | Example |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Component folder/file | `PascalCase` | `Primitives/Button/Button.tsx` |
| Props interface | `I` + name | `IButton` |
| Import | `@/components/Primitives/...` | `@/components/Primitives/Label/Label` |

Do **not** use legacy prefixes (`Atom*`, `Molecule*`) or paths (`Atoms/`, `Molecules/`).

### Primitive example

```tsx
// components/Primitives/Button/Button.tsx
const Button = ({
  className = '',
  text,
  type = EButtonType.primary,
  disabled = false,
  onClick,
  isLoading = false,
  children,
  ...props
}: IButton) => {
  // …
}
```

### Template rules

- Structure + presentation only (no heavy business logic)
- Compose Primitives / Organisms
- Accept props for data and handlers from the page

### Page rules (backoffice)

Mirror `users/page.tsx` / `clients/page.tsx`:
- `useAuthorization({ anyRoles: ['ADMIN'] })` when admin-only
- TanStack Query + `LayoutWrapper` + `OrganismTable` + drawer modals

---

## Layouts

1. Root — `app/layout.tsx`
2. Locale — `app/[locale]/layout.tsx` (+ marketing shell)
3. Private — `app/[locale]/(private)/layout.tsx` (auth, sidebar)
4. Shared — `components/Layouts/` (`LayoutWrapper`, `LocaleMarketingShell`, …)

**Marketing shell** skips header/footer for auth + backoffice prefixes (dashboard, products, product-categories, clients, quotes, invoices, users, …).

**Private layout**: `ProtectedRoute`, role-gated sidebar via `useAuthorization`, mobile overlay.

---

## API Integration (TanStack Query)

- Client helpers in `src/lib/*-api.ts` (e.g. `product-api.ts`, `sales-api.ts`, `user-api.ts`)
- Use `Api` from `StandardApi` + `CommonFunction.createHeaders`
- Invalidate related query keys on mutation success
- Do not retry 4xx; keep mutation retry off by default

```tsx
const { data, isLoading, error } = useQuery({
  queryKey: ['products', page, search],
  queryFn: () => fetchProducts({ page, search }),
})
```

**Proxies** (`src/app/api/**`): forward `Authorization` with `createHeaders({ customToken: authorization })`.

---

## Forms (TanStack Form + Zod)

- Zod schema for validation
- `@tanstack/react-form` for field state
- Show errors from `state.meta.errors`
- `Button` / form submit: wire explicit `onClick` → `form.handleSubmit()` (buttons render `type="button"`)

---

## State

- **Local** `useState` for UI-only state
- **Context** for feature UI (Modal, Toast, Cart, MobileSidebar, …)
- Prefer Query cache for server data over duplicating in stores

---

## Routing

- File-based under `app/[locale]/`
- Shared path helpers in `src/lib/routes.ts`
- Private group requires session; redirect non-admins from admin pages

---

## Styling (Tailwind)

- Prefer scale utilities over arbitrary pixels (`size-8` not `size-[32px]`) unless Figma demands exact values
- **No hardcoded hex** — use theme Tailwind classes from `src/theme/colors.ts` (`text-gray-900`, `bg-primary-500`, `border-neutral-200`, …)
- Motion: intentional Framer Motion (hover, presence, sidebar width) — not decorative noise

---

## Icons (SVG)

Location: `src/assets/icons/` → register in `Primitives/Icon/IconTypes.ts` + `IconComponentsEnum`.

Standards:
- `width="1em" height="1em"`, `viewBox`, `stroke`/`fill` = `currentColor`
- Prefer `Icon` `handleClick` — **do not** wrap icons in extra `<button>`s
- Use i18n for accessible labels/tooltips where the component supports them

---

## Text & i18n (short)

- **Always** `Label` for visible text (never raw `<p>` / `<span>` for copy)
- Typography only via `variant` — see `label-typography.mdc`
- **Always** `useTranslations` / `getTranslations` — see `i18n.mdc`

---

## Collapsible sidebar pattern

- Local open/collapsed state
- Animate width with Framer Motion
- Center content when collapsed (`items-center` / `justify-center`)
- Hide labels when collapsed; keep icon affordances

---

## Backoffice & Sales

| Area | Notes |
| --- | --- |
| Guard | `useAuthorization({ anyRoles: ['ADMIN'] })` |
| Lists | `LayoutWrapper` + `OrganismTable` + modal CRUD |
| Products | `/products`, `/product-categories` — dynamic catalog (images, badges, materials, sizes, gravure) |
| Sales | `/clients`, `/quotes`, `/invoices` — TND (`formatMoney` / `fr-TN`) |
| Flow | Client → Devis (`DEV-YYYY-####`) → Facture (`FAC-YYYY-####`) → mark paid |
| Badge | prop `text` (not `label`) |

Money and document numbering stay consistent with `sales-api.ts`.

---

## Development checklist (new feature)

1. Types/interfaces as needed  
2. Primitive only if reusable across features  
3. Template for page structure  
4. App Router page with Query + mutations  
5. Zod + TanStack Form for inputs  
6. Keys in **fr / en / ar** `common.json`  
7. Theme colors + `Label` variants — no hex / no ad-hoc text sizes on `Label`

---

## Summary — non-negotiables

1. Components: **Primitives / Organisms / Templates** (not Atoms/Molecules)
2. Text: `Label` + correct `EVariantLabel`
3. Copy: next-intl in all three locales
4. Colors: theme Tailwind classes only
5. Icons: `currentColor`, `handleClick` on `Icon`
6. API proxies: forward bearer token from the request
7. Form buttons: explicit submit `onClick`
